# Project 1: End-to-End Indian Bookkeeping & Statutory Tax Cycle
### Platform: Zoho Books Cloud Sandbox | Data Base: INR (₹)
### Organization: Vedic Decor Private Limited (Home Furnishings Sector)

## 📌 Project Overview
This project simulates the complete end-to-end accounting cycle for an Indian corporate enterprise over a primary operating period. The workflow moves raw transaction documents from an initially unorganized state into a fully reconciled, audit-ready Trial Balance, Profit & Loss sheet, and Balance Sheet, completely aligned with Indian Goods and Services Tax (GST) and Tax Deducted at Source (TDS) parameters.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Compliance Matrix
* **Accounting Engine:** Zoho Books (Cloud Architecture)
* **Local Tax Controls:** CGST (9%), SGST (9%), Local HSN Tracking (Goods: 940360)
* **Withholding Infrastructure:** Income Tax Section 194C (Contractor Deductions)
* **Reconciliation Target:** HDFC Corporate Current Account (Zero Variance)

